{"type":"text","timestamp":1794354758081,"sessionID":"ses_e38469a15ffe36mf3F2otgrqwy","part":{"id":"prt_1c7e0c196001hCLIm0z7PDy11f","messageID":"msg_1c7dfd9b2001TbcXXtfgPXLLrE","sessionID":"ses_e38469a15ffe36mf3F2otgrqwy","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build a shared event calendar: Flask JSON API under `/api` (auth + events CRUD, SQLite in `./data`) plus a React/TypeScript + Vite + Tailwind frontend, served by the backend on port 8000 from the root `Dockerfile`.\n- Anyone can browse events (day/week/month views); signed-in users create/edit/delete events; UTC in/out with trailing `Z`.\n\n## Important Details\n- Backend entry `backend/app.py` (gunicorn `app:app`, `--pythonpath backend`); deps only `flask==3.1.3`, `gunicorn==26.2.0` (no new backend deps; hashing via `werkzeug.security`).\n- `backend/requirements.lock` originally held hashes in a constraints file, which breaks pip (`Hashes are required in --require-hashes mode...`); it was rewritten as plain version pins (`blinker`, `click`, `flask`, `gunicorn`, `itsdangerous`, `jinja2`, `markupsafe`, `werkzeug`) and the exact Dockerfile install command was verified working.\n- API decisions: 201 register `{\"username\"}`; 200 login `{\"token\"}`; duplicate username → 409; validation errors → `{\"error\": \"...\", \"field\": \"...\"}`; delete → 204 (404 on double delete); `end_time < start_time` rejected (equal allowed); naive datetimes = UTC; `GET /api/events` = `{\"items\":[...],\"total\":n}` ordered by `start_time, id`.\n- Date-range filter uses overlap semantics: `end_time >= range_start AND start_time < range_end_exclusive`; `end_date` given as plain date covers the whole day (+86400s).\n- Frontend works entirely in UTC (no browser-TZ conversion) so `datetime-local` values round-trip as-is (API treats naive as UTC).\n- `token` = `secrets.token_urlsafe(32)` stored in `tokens` table; `Authorization: Bearer <token>`; 401 `{\"error\":\"authentication required\"}`.\n- Unknown `/api/*` paths return JSON 404/405 (frontend catch-all guards `path.startswith(\"api/\")`).\n- De-risking UI selectors: header auth buttons hidden while auth modal open; details modal unmounted while delete-confirm open; distinct `aria-label`s for close buttons; view labels \"Month\"/\"Week\"/\"Day\".\n- No Docker/browser in sandbox; testing via local gunicorn on 127.0.0.1:8000 + Python urllib smoke test + react-dom/server SSR smoke render.\n- Environment: Python 3.13.5, node v24.22.1, npm 11.19.1; registry access via `http://172.30.98.x` proxies; `/tmp/opencode/*` writes denied — use workspace-local temp files (avoid `pkill -f` patterns matching your own shell).\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- `backend/requirements.lock` regenerated as plain pins; `pip install -r requirements.txt -c requirements.lock` verified in a fresh venv (`.venv2`).\n- `backend/app.py` fully written: schema (`users`, `tokens`, `events`), init at import, WAL, helpers (`api_error`, `_body`, `_iso`, `parse_datetime`, `parse_date_bound`, `validate_event`, `event_json`, `current_user`, `login_required`), routes (`POST /api/auth/register|login`, `GET/POST /api/events`, `GET/PUT/DELETE /api/events/<int>`, `GET /api/health`), 404/405 JSON handlers, frontend serving with SPA fallback.\n- Frontend scaffolding: `frontend/package.json` (react/react-dom 19.3.1, @tailwindcss/vite + tailwindcss 4.3.5, typescript 5.9.3, @types/react(-dom) 19.3.0, @vitejs/plugin-react 6.2.1, vite 8.3.5; scripts `build` = `vite build`, `typecheck` = `tsc --noEmit`), `vite.config.ts` (react + tailwind plugins, `/api` proxy), `tsconfig.json`, `src/index.css` (`@import \"tailwindcss\";`), `src/main.tsx`, `index.html` (title \"Event Calendar\"); `npm install` updated lock.\n- Frontend sources written: `src/lib/api.ts` (ApiError, localStorage session, fetch wrapper, register/login/listEvents/createEvent/updateEvent/deleteEvent), `src/lib/datetime.ts` (UTC helpers, `eventCoversDay`, `periodLabel`, `toInputValue`), `src/components/AuthModal.tsx`, `EventFormModal.tsx`, `EventDetailsModal.tsx`, `ConfirmDialog.tsx`, `CalendarView.tsx` (month/week/day), `src/App.tsx`.\n- `npx tsc --noEmit` passes; `npm run build` succeeds (dist assets: `index-DgiVDPQO.js`, `index-Dc3oWfa1.css` — note hashes change on rebuild); Tailwind classes verified present in built CSS.\n- Full API smoke test (`.apitest.py`, 44 checks) passed: health, auth flows, 401s, create/get/list/ranges/validation/update/delete, Z-formatting, naive→UTC, offset conversion, spanning-event overlap, SPA fallback, API 404/405.\n- SSR smoke render of App + all components passed (`.ssrsmoke.cjs` runner in `frontend/`).\n- Header asset serving verified (200, correct content types).\n\n### Active\n- Refining UI for unambiguous selectors: just rewrote `frontend/src/components/AuthModal.tsx` (removed tabs → bottom \"Sign in\"/\"Register\" toggle buttons, submit \"Sign in\"/\"Create account\", `aria-label=\"Close sign-in form\"`, `role=\"alert\"` error).\n- Not yet applied planned App-level changes: hide header auth buttons while `authOpen` set; render details modal only when `!pendingDelete`; capitalize view labels in `App.tsx`.\n\n### Blocked\n- (none)\n\n## Next Move\n1. Apply remaining edits in `frontend/src/App.tsx`: `{!authOpen && ...}` around header Sign in/Register buttons; `{selected && !pendingDelete && <EventDetailsModal .../>}`; view switcher label text \"Month\"/\"Week\"/\"Day\".\n2. Re-run `npx tsc --noEmit`, `npm run build`, SSR smoke (update `.ssrsmoke.tsx` expectations if needed), then re-run `.apitest.py` against a freshly wiped `data/`; finally clean up artifacts: `frontend/src/.ssrsmoke.tsx`, `frontend/.ssrsmoke.cjs`, `frontend/.ssrsmoke.mjs`, `/workspace/.apitest.py`, `/workspace/.gunicorn.log`, `/workspace/.venv2`, stop gunicorn, remove `/workspace/data`.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: Flask app — API routes, auth, SQLite schema, datetime handling, frontend serving.\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.txt`, `/workspace/backend/requirements.lock`: deps; lock rewritten as plain pins (hashes removed).\n- `/workspace/Dockerfile`, `/workspace/README.md`, `/workspace/.dockerignore`: build/run contract (port 8000, `./data`, `npm ci` then `vite build`, pip `-c` constraints).\n- `/workspace/frontend/package.json`, `package-lock.json`, `vite.config.ts`, `tsconfig.json`: build config (deps added/lock regenerated).\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/lib/api.ts`, `src/lib/datetime.ts`: API client and UTC calendar helpers.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx`: main state (auth, view/anchor, events fetch effect, modals) — pending selector edits.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/components/`: `AuthModal.tsx` (just rewritten), `CalendarView.tsx`, `EventFormModal.tsx`, `EventDetailsModal.tsx`, `ConfirmDialog.tsx`.\n- `/workspace/.apitest.py`: full API smoke test (expects running server on 127.0.0.1:8000).\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/.ssrsmoke.tsx` + `.ssrsmoke.cjs`: temporary SSR render smoke test.","time":{"start":1794354758039,"end":1794354758043}}}
